Coded the abortion topic for Chris Garten: his Yea vote on SB 1(ss) (2022ss) establishes rung 4 (ban with exceptions for rape, incest, and serious risk to the mother's life), supported by the roll call and the enrolled act's operative text. The bill-tracking page was coded as non-supporting (third-party characterization, like a pointer page) since it never names Garten's own act. Written to `coder-3.json`.
